title: 'pallet-alliance: reject an item repeated within one add_unscrupulous_items batch'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      add_unscrupulous_items now returns AlreadyUnscrupulous when the same account or website
      appears more than once in one call. Before, both copies were stored, and a single later
      removal left the item listed.
crates:
  - name: pallet-alliance
    bump: patch
